    66	## 1. Models
    67	
    68	- **𝔐₁ (cycloharvey §§2, 3.4).**
    69	  - Targets are Laurent polynomials g ∈ Λ_I with I ⊆ [−d,d]∖{0}, or g ∈ L_{r,M} for
